# Events user-service publishes to Kafka through the outbox pattern (account request, block, email).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1/user/outbox
@adminToken = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_auth.http
@eventId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### FAILED events, paginated (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/failed?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Retry a FAILED event: back to PENDING with 0 attempts; 409 if it is not FAILED (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{eventId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
